            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que a auto-atribuição é um conceito de programação tão poderoso em jogos?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque nos permite rastrear dados do jogo que mudam ao longo do tempo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque é necessário criar colisões</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Porque é necessário para desenhar sprites</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque nos permite rastrear dados do jogo que mudam ao longo do tempo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Subtraia um do valor da variável <code>playerLives</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLives = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerLives = playerLives - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lives left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerLives);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerLives = playerLives - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lives left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerLives);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game over!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerLives</code> seguido de <code>-</code> e finalmente <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossSpawned = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bossSpawned = bossSpawned;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bossSpawned);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"bossSpawned\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bossSpawned</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146703,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score = score + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>01</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sword shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory = inventory + \" /><text value=\"&quot; potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>sword shield potion</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>potion sword shield</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>inventory potion</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>sword shield potion</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146705,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Subtraia 50 do valor da variável.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"--\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"231\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"coins -= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146706,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba <code>Level up, Silvia</code> no console adicionando <code>\" Silvia\"</code> ao valor da variável <code>message</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"--\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level up,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message += \" /><text value=\"&quot; Silvia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>message</code> seguido de <code>+=</code> e depois <code>\" Silvia\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146707,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth -= \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>7</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-7</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146708,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" frameCount = \" /><text value=\"14000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"frameCount++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(frameCount);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>14001</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>14000</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>13999</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>14001</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146709,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesLeft = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemiesLeft--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemiesLeft);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>29</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>31</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>28</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>29</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146710,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é um loop infinito em um jogo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um loop que executa seu bloco de código repetidamente para sempre</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um loop que executa seu bloco de código uma vez</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um loop que pula seu bloco de código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um loop que executa seu bloco de código repetidamente para sempre.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146711,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que este loop executará seu código repetidamente para sempre?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque a condição permanece <code>true</code> para sempre</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque a condição permanece <code>false</code> para sempre</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Porque a condição muda de <code>false</code> para <code>true</code> para sempre</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque a condição permanece <code>true</code> para sempre.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146712,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual código o loop while executa repetidamente?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating game state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Stopping game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>console.log(\"Updating game state\");</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let isRunning = false;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>console.log(\"Stopping game\");</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>console.log(\"Updating game state\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146713,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que este loop while pula seu bloco de código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemies...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A condição é <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A condição é <code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos dizer se ele pula seu bloco de código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A condição é <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146714,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pule o bloco de código do loop while definindo a condição como <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Start match!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Next frame:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Update and render&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Match ended!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 146715,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para executar o loop, atribua <code>true</code> a <code>isPlaying</code> fora do bloco de código.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPlaying = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPlaying === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Next frame!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPlaying = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 146716,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que este loop não para?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isGameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing background music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isGameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque a variável <code>isGameRunning</code> não é atualizada para <code>false</code> dentro do bloco de código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque todos os loops <code>while</code> não param</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Porque a variável <code>isGameRunning</code> atualiza para <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque a variável <code>isGameRunning</code> não é atualizada para <code>false</code> dentro do bloco de código.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 146717,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasMoreLoot = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasMoreLoot === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" hasMoreLoot = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loot found:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You picked up a potion!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Loot found:</code> e então <code>You picked up a potion!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Este código não exibe nada no console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Loot found:</code> e então <code>You picked up a potion!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 146718,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que este loop while repita seu bloco de código enquanto <code>isPaused</code> for igual a <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>===</code> seguido de <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
