            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que este <em>while loop</em> não executará seu bloco de código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isBossFight = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isBossFight === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Play boss music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isBossFight = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A condição retorna <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A condição retorna <code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A variável <code>isBossFight</code> é atualizada para <code>false</code> dentro do bloco de código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A condição retorna <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
